Let's go!

00:01:46.040 --> 00:01:51.040
Boy x Girl

00:02:00.430 --> 00:02:02.810
Chiaki, your family consists of three sisters, right?

00:02:02.810 --> 00:02:04.060
Yeah.

00:02:04.060 --> 00:02:06.680
So there is no relation there, right?

00:02:07.190 --> 00:02:09.520
What are you talking about?

00:02:09.520 --> 00:02:10.610
Minami.

00:02:10.610 --> 00:02:11.560
Tou.

00:02:11.560 --> 00:02:12.730
Ma.

00:02:12.730 --> 00:02:16.070
Touma Minami
Written as "Winter Horse", pronounced "Touma".

00:02:16.070 --> 00:02:16.240
Written as "Winter Horse", pronounced "Touma".

00:02:18.200 --> 00:02:20.450
You don't even know she's in class 5-1?

00:02:20.450 --> 00:02:22.620
You've never met her?

00:02:22.620 --> 00:02:24.700
Touma?

00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:29.790
Perfect. He can be my younger brother.

00:02:29.790 --> 00:02:33.540
What? She said something out of character!

00:02:33.540 --> 00:02:36.920
Enough with the jokes. Let me see how he looks like.

00:02:39.510 --> 00:02:41.220
Look, there.

00:02:41.640 --> 00:02:43.260
The one on the left.

00:02:52.770 --> 00:02:53.770
Huh?

00:02:59.150 --> 00:03:01.070
He looks really manly.

00:03:01.070 --> 00:03:04.160
What? You haven't realized that it's a she?

00:03:04.160 --> 00:03:08.500
She's already decided on a brother, and there is no stopping Chiaki.

00:03:08.500 --> 00:03:10.160
I must make him my younger brother.

00:03:10.160 --> 00:03:11.500
She's not going back on her word.

00:03:11.500 --> 00:03:14.710
She is probably thinking of her as a guy.

00:03:14.710 --> 00:03:17.800
What did you say? Bring it on if you have the balls!

00:03:17.800 --> 00:03:20.970
Guys don't fight with girls.

00:03:20.970 --> 00:03:24.260
To talk about guys and girls, you piss me off!

00:03:24.260 --> 00:03:26.720
Then, from today onwards, I'll be a guy!

00:03:26.720 --> 00:03:27.890
Now, bring it!

00:03:34.020 --> 00:03:37.360
She too, is a stubborn sort of person...

00:03:37.360 --> 00:03:38.860
Let's go back.

00:03:38.860 --> 00:03:40.570
What? That's all?

00:03:40.570 --> 00:03:41.740
Come!

00:03:49.160 --> 00:03:50.330
Chiaki!

00:03:50.330 --> 00:03:51.620
Are you alright?

00:03:58.760 --> 00:04:02.090
Hey dumbass. That hurt.

00:04:03.340 --> 00:04:05.470
You were the one who wasn't paying attention.

00:04:05.470 --> 00:04:09.180
When a girl says that it hurts, the guy should be apologizing.

00:04:09.930 --> 00:04:11.390
The guy?

00:04:11.810 --> 00:04:13.310
Where's your "sorry"?

00:04:14.400 --> 00:04:15.690
Sorry...

00:04:15.690 --> 00:04:17.270
More clearly!

00:04:17.270 --> 00:04:18.570
Sorry!

00:04:19.530 --> 00:04:22.900
Usually, she is rather stubborn, but now, she is even more stubborn.

00:04:23.400 --> 00:04:24.820
It's good that you understand.

00:04:24.820 --> 00:04:26.820
A guy should act like a guy.

00:04:26.820 --> 00:04:28.490
You don't act like a woman.

00:04:28.490 --> 00:04:30.540
You too.

00:04:30.540 --> 00:04:33.210
I'm a guy! So it's alright!

00:04:33.210 --> 00:04:35.040
When is your birthday?

00:04:35.040 --> 00:04:37.210
If you are younger than me, I will not forgive you.

00:04:37.210 --> 00:04:38.040
What?

00:04:38.040 --> 00:04:39.050
Are you a year five?

00:04:39.380 --> 00:04:41.050
My birthday is in April.

00:04:41.050 --> 00:04:43.010
Wait.

00:04:43.010 --> 00:04:45.180
Erm, all this...

00:04:45.180 --> 00:04:48.430
Let's just leave it at that.

00:04:48.430 --> 00:04:49.600
Leave it?

00:04:49.600 --> 00:04:52.060
Her birthday... loses.

00:04:52.060 --> 00:04:55.730
My name is Chiaki. A girl whose name has "autumn" in it.

00:04:57.190 --> 00:05:01.280
And you are called Touma. A guy whose name has "winter" in it.

00:05:01.280 --> 00:05:03.490
Why don't you try having a winter without autumn?

00:05:03.860 --> 00:05:06.160
The squirrels have nothing to eat before they hibernate.

00:05:06.160 --> 00:05:08.990
Do not drag squirrels into our argument!

00:05:08.990 --> 00:05:11.160
Winter comes after autumn.

00:05:11.160 --> 00:05:12.870
And hence, everything is peaceful.

00:05:12.870 --> 00:05:15.540
So, when is your birthday?

00:05:15.540 --> 00:05:17.670
Everyone will obtain happiness.

00:05:17.670 --> 00:05:18.960
Birthday...

00:05:18.960 --> 00:05:21.250
Stop asking a girl's age!

00:05:21.250 --> 00:05:23.420
No. I know what your age is!

00:05:23.420 --> 00:05:25.380
What a rude fellow.

00:05:25.380 --> 00:05:27.640
I am your senior.

00:05:28.510 --> 00:05:31.510
And thus, I will teach you everything from the beginning.

00:05:33.850 --> 00:05:36.270
She really took him as her brother.

00:05:36.270 --> 00:05:38.020
It's her personal younger brother.

00:05:45.650 --> 00:05:47.950
You don't look like a guy at all.

00:05:47.950 --> 00:05:49.320
Really?

00:05:50.280 --> 00:05:52.490
Makoto. Come here.

00:05:52.490 --> 00:05:54.450
What's wrong, Minami?

00:05:54.450 --> 00:05:56.290
Exchange

00:05:56.830 --> 00:05:59.170
Red! It suits you!

00:05:59.170 --> 00:06:01.000
Black. It suits you!

00:06:01.000 --> 00:06:02.420
Really?

00:06:03.590 --> 00:06:04.630
Minami-ke.

00:06:10.600 --> 00:06:14.220
So Makoto, you're now learning how to cook?

00:06:14.220 --> 00:06:19.190
Yeah. This is so that I can help Haruka-san in the future!

00:06:22.520 --> 00:06:26.940
So what are you planning to do with that egg?

00:06:26.940 --> 00:06:31.570
Peeling it. It's common knowledge that you should peel an egg before cooking it.

00:06:31.740 --> 00:06:32.780
Not common knowledge

00:06:32.780 --> 00:06:34.040
I see.
Not common knowledge

00:06:34.040 --> 00:06:34.160
I see.

00:06:34.160 --> 00:06:39.170
Also, there seems to be a saying, "People who are trainees are called eggs".

00:06:39.170 --> 00:06:41.500
Makoto is a chef's egg.

00:06:41.500 --> 00:06:44.340
That means I'm an egg!

00:06:44.340 --> 00:06:46.260
Is that so? Hey?

00:06:46.260 --> 00:06:49.010
Wow. Well done!

00:06:49.800 --> 00:06:51.760
Chiaki is amazing!

00:06:51.760 --> 00:06:55.890
There is a little bit of difficulty in cooking up the perfect egg.

00:06:56.220 --> 00:06:58.600
Boiling an egg is common knowledge.

00:06:58.600 --> 00:07:00.690
In order for the yolk to remain in the middle,

00:07:00.690 --> 00:07:03.110
All you need to do is to stir it from time to time, and you're fine.

00:07:04.400 --> 00:07:06.280
Hey hey, Minami!

00:07:07.070 --> 00:07:11.490
What's this skill which most elementary school students usually won't have?

00:07:11.490 --> 00:07:15.450
Also, you look as if you cook regularly.

00:07:15.450 --> 00:07:16.580
I do.

00:07:17.950 --> 00:07:21.710
I help Haruka-neesama cook every day.

00:07:21.710 --> 00:07:23.880
E-Every day.

00:07:23.880 --> 00:07:29.420
I am different from that stray dog who only helped once.

00:07:30.470 --> 00:07:33.340
If you cannot cook a simple thing like an egg,

00:07:33.340 --> 00:07:36.510
Then you have no right to be Haruka-neesama's support.

00:07:37.680 --> 00:07:41.230
You may have the superior ability to boil an egg.

00:07:41.850 --> 00:07:43.150
I'll give you that.

00:07:43.150 --> 00:07:44.190
But!

00:07:44.190 --> 00:07:46.020
You know what?

00:07:46.020 --> 00:07:47.360
It's not over even though you've boiled it!

00:07:47.360 --> 00:07:48.730
It will be cooled and peeled!

00:07:48.730 --> 00:07:52.700
Finally, the egg which will be eaten... What would... what would its feelings be?

00:07:52.700 --> 00:07:53.910
The egg's...

00:07:53.910 --> 00:07:54.910
Yes!

00:07:54.910 --> 00:07:56.580
I know.

00:07:56.580 --> 00:08:00.370
Because I'm a chef's egg!

00:08:00.370 --> 00:08:03.250
Although I don't know what's going on, it's amazing.

00:08:03.250 --> 00:08:05.880
No. I have no idea what he is trying to say.

00:08:08.500 --> 00:08:10.260
Come, Minami!

00:08:12.010 --> 00:08:13.930
Go ahead and boil me!

00:08:15.640 --> 00:08:16.850
Come boil me!

00:08:16.850 --> 00:08:18.350
Boil me!

00:08:18.350 --> 00:08:20.020
Boil me, Minami!

00:08:20.020 --> 00:08:21.770
BOIL!

00:08:30.650 --> 00:08:31.740
Why?

00:08:31.740 --> 00:08:35.490
Because before you peel an egg, you need to smash it first.

00:08:35.490 --> 00:08:36.370
Right?

00:08:36.700 --> 00:08:38.120
Minami-ke!

00:08:39.870 --> 00:08:41.290
I'm back!

00:08:44.710 --> 00:08:46.250
Welcome back.

00:08:49.170 --> 00:08:51.130
I'm Minami Touma.

00:08:51.130 --> 00:08:52.340
Nice meeting you.

00:08:52.590 --> 00:08:53.170
Touma Minami

00:08:53.170 --> 00:08:55.550
Your name's written as "Winter"?
Touma Minami

00:08:55.550 --> 00:08:55.680
Your name's written as "Winter"?

00:08:56.140 --> 00:08:58.970
And now you have become Chiaki's younger brother?

00:08:59.430 --> 00:09:02.220
You shouldn't randomly make someone your younger brother.

00:09:03.060 --> 00:09:06.270
Although I am also a girl, I've been acting as a boy.

00:09:10.440 --> 00:09:13.190
What? You're a girl?

00:09:13.190 --> 00:09:16.780
Is that so? I thought you were... Right?

00:09:16.780 --> 00:09:19.280
Touma! Hey, Touma!

00:09:19.280 --> 00:09:21.700
I think I should explain it clearly.

00:09:21.700 --> 00:09:25.330
Don't say "acting". Be serious about it, idiot!

00:09:25.330 --> 00:09:27.670
What? Do you want to continue what we were arguing about?

00:09:32.420 --> 00:09:34.260
Save me!

00:09:34.260 --> 00:09:36.260
How is that? Give up?

00:09:36.590 --> 00:09:38.470
Touma is strong.

00:09:39.390 --> 00:09:41.680
Haruka-san! Hello!

00:09:41.680 --> 00:09:43.390
Hey, it's Mako-chan.

00:09:43.390 --> 00:09:45.180
Haruka-san. This is for you.

00:09:45.180 --> 00:09:47.060
The cook book I've talked about a while ago.

00:09:48.940 --> 00:09:50.110
This is...

00:09:53.070 --> 00:09:54.190
You...

00:09:55.070 --> 00:09:56.570
Where have I seen you?

00:10:00.240 --> 00:10:01.780
Touma. Follow me.

00:10:03.370 --> 00:10:05.330
Lend me your curtains for a bit.

00:10:09.170 --> 00:10:11.040
<i>Someone he knows?</i>

00:10:11.040 --> 00:10:13.630
<i>Well, they are from the same school.</i>

00:10:15.300 --> 00:10:18.430
Wait. Then won't it become a very strange situation?

00:10:18.430 --> 00:10:20.550
What's the strange situation?

00:10:22.890 --> 00:10:25.470
You've found out, right?

00:10:25.470 --> 00:10:28.270
I'm Chiaki's classmate, Makoto.

00:10:28.270 --> 00:10:29.440
Makoto...

00:10:29.440 --> 00:10:30.230
C'mon...

00:10:30.230 --> 00:10:33.020
We switched bags the other day.

00:10:33.020 --> 00:10:34.780
Ah, it's you.

00:10:34.780 --> 00:10:35.990
That boy.

00:10:35.990 --> 00:10:39.200
Then, what's with that outfit?

00:10:39.200 --> 00:10:40.490
There are many reasons for it.

00:10:40.870 --> 00:10:44.490
In any case, I do not know why I am wearing a girl's outfit.

00:10:44.910 --> 00:10:46.950
Anyway, keep this a secret.

00:10:46.950 --> 00:10:48.540
Although I do not know what it is about,

00:10:48.540 --> 00:10:49.920
You sure have it tough.

00:10:49.920 --> 00:10:54.210
Aren't you acting as a guy as well?

00:10:54.210 --> 00:10:56.050
As a younger brother.

00:10:56.050 --> 00:10:58.340
Something like that...

00:10:58.340 --> 00:10:59.880
I do not want to hear your explanations,

00:10:59.880 --> 00:11:02.220
Do your best! Don't let it slip!

00:11:02.220 --> 00:11:04.390
Yeah. I'll do my best.

00:11:06.100 --> 00:11:07.390
They're back.

00:11:12.690 --> 00:11:15.610
Hmm... Well...

00:11:16.150 --> 00:11:17.610
Although I've said a lot in the past,

00:11:18.990 --> 00:11:20.570
I am a boy.

00:11:31.120 --> 00:11:33.040
Just call me a boy!

00:11:33.040 --> 00:11:34.590
Call you a boy?

00:11:36.380 --> 00:11:38.130
No matter how you say it, I'm a boy!

00:11:38.130 --> 00:11:39.300
How should I say it?

00:11:39.300 --> 00:11:40.260
How would I say it?

00:11:43.470 --> 00:11:46.060
Touma. Come here for a bit.

00:12:04.660 --> 00:12:07.280
No matter how you look at it, he's more feminine than Chiaki.

00:12:07.280 --> 00:12:09.330
Shut up! Shut up!

00:12:09.330 --> 00:12:11.080
No!

00:12:11.080 --> 00:12:12.790
Touma is a boy!

00:12:12.790 --> 00:12:15.750
What? What are you making a ruckus about, Mako-chan.

00:12:17.210 --> 00:12:18.630
Do you want to confirm it?

00:12:18.630 --> 00:12:20.210
I'm sorry!

00:12:20.210 --> 00:12:23.180
She's a girl. I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

00:12:33.020 --> 00:12:34.140
Shuuichi
Makoto

00:12:34.140 --> 00:12:35.520
I have decided. I'm going to show my true self to Haruka-san and Chiaki.
Shuuichi
Makoto

00:12:35.520 --> 00:12:40.190
I have decided. I'm going to show my true self to Haruka-san and Chiaki.

00:12:43.650 --> 00:12:47.530
I can't deceive Haruka-san any longer.

00:12:47.530 --> 00:12:49.450
So it's okay if you just lie to Chiaki.

00:12:49.450 --> 00:12:52.750
Although the father of Mako-chan was me,

00:12:52.750 --> 00:12:54.330
I won't stop you.

00:12:54.330 --> 00:12:55.870
Since it might be interesting.

00:12:55.870 --> 00:13:00.130
Father? If that's the case, let's remove the "na" from your name, add "chan", and call you Mother.

00:13:00.130 --> 00:13:02.880
I don't remember giving birth to you.

00:13:02.880 --> 00:13:05.300
Oh yeah, I will call Touma "Father" then.

00:13:05.300 --> 00:13:07.590
Oh, Father and Mother.

00:13:07.590 --> 00:13:10.350
Please leave that talk for later.

00:13:10.350 --> 00:13:15.100
Woman's clothing can no longer suppress my wildness as a man.

00:13:15.100 --> 00:13:18.310
He's even more feminine today.

00:13:18.310 --> 00:13:19.940
Learn a little, Father.

00:13:19.940 --> 00:13:21.690
Shut it, Mother.

00:13:21.690 --> 00:13:23.070
Listen to me!

00:13:23.070 --> 00:13:24.820
Shut up, idiots.

00:13:24.820 --> 00:13:26.240
I'm back.

00:13:26.240 --> 00:13:27.740
Welcome back!

00:13:28.200 --> 00:13:29.910
We're making curry for tonight.

00:13:29.910 --> 00:13:31.370
Idio-

00:13:31.370 --> 00:13:32.450
What's wrong?

00:13:32.450 --> 00:13:34.790
My lips chapped.

00:13:34.790 --> 00:13:39.210
It must be dry that's why, let's apply some lip cream.

00:13:50.010 --> 00:13:53.560
If you want to say it, say it now since no one is talking at the moment.

00:14:07.910 --> 00:14:10.700
Touma, stay for dinner tonight.

00:14:10.700 --> 00:14:13.370
Of course. Why wouldn't I?

00:14:13.370 --> 00:14:14.910
Will Mako-chan be eating too?

00:14:16.210 --> 00:14:17.410
Erm...

00:14:17.410 --> 00:14:20.330
My, Mako-chan's lips is also chapped.

00:14:20.830 --> 00:14:22.290
Because she's very nervous that's why.

00:14:22.670 --> 00:14:24.210
Let me apply it for you.

00:14:31.220 --> 00:14:32.600
Indirect kiss-

00:14:32.600 --> 00:14:33.890
Touma, be quiet.

00:14:33.890 --> 00:14:38.140
Well then, after the lips have been moisturized, Mako-chan is going confess!

00:14:40.060 --> 00:14:42.110
Erm... to tell the truth...

00:14:42.440 --> 00:14:44.820
I'm actually a male!

00:14:52.830 --> 00:14:54.280
Eh...

00:14:59.080 --> 00:15:00.420
You're not angry?

00:15:00.420 --> 00:15:01.290
Yeah.

00:15:01.290 --> 00:15:02.580
It's nothing.

00:15:03.340 --> 00:15:04.750
Really?

00:15:04.750 --> 00:15:05.800
Yeah.

00:15:05.800 --> 00:15:07.420
You're really a drag.

00:15:07.880 --> 00:15:11.510
Come, Chiaki, let's go prepare the curry.

00:15:11.510 --> 00:15:14.560
Yes. Touma, come over and help too.

00:15:20.600 --> 00:15:23.230
Geez, whether it's you or the other person.

00:15:23.230 --> 00:15:27.440
I guess Mako-chan is trying to imitate you and act like a male, right?

00:15:28.400 --> 00:15:31.910
We were a little shocked when Touma came to our house the first time.

00:15:32.990 --> 00:15:36.160
Anyway, is Mako-chan really going to act like a male?

00:15:36.160 --> 00:15:39.040
If that's so, she should at least try a little harder, like you.

00:15:40.000 --> 00:15:41.870
Don't tell me you guys...

00:15:41.870 --> 00:15:44.670
But then, having a comrade is good.

00:15:44.670 --> 00:15:46.210
A comrade who dressed as man.

00:15:47.710 --> 00:15:48.590
Eh?

00:15:51.510 --> 00:15:53.140
That's a relief...

00:15:53.140 --> 00:15:54.850
What an unexpected outcome.

00:15:54.850 --> 00:15:56.470
Hey, Mako-chan.

00:15:58.020 --> 00:16:01.440
You might not be able to revert to your male self.

00:16:04.480 --> 00:16:05.400
Eh?

00:16:05.400 --> 00:16:07.190
Minami-ke!

00:16:07.980 --> 00:16:09.570
What did you say?

00:16:11.530 --> 00:16:14.200
Mako-chan is still regarded as a girl?

00:16:14.820 --> 00:16:16.030
Yeah.

00:16:16.030 --> 00:16:20.000
Your confession was misinterpreted.

00:16:20.000 --> 00:16:23.540
How could it be? I mustered all of my courage to say that!

00:16:23.540 --> 00:16:24.880
Say it again then.

00:16:24.880 --> 00:16:26.420
Easy for you to say!

00:16:27.840 --> 00:16:31.720
You will be nervous if Haruka and Chiaki are together.

00:16:33.180 --> 00:16:37.260
How about telling it to Chiaki first in school?

00:16:37.260 --> 00:16:38.430
That's it!

00:16:47.020 --> 00:16:49.230
Minami!

00:16:50.480 --> 00:16:52.950
I'm male!

00:16:58.830 --> 00:17:00.950
Huh? My message didn't get across?

00:17:00.950 --> 00:17:04.460
Hey idiot, what are you being so loud all of a sudden for?

00:17:08.590 --> 00:17:12.760
You have to be more mannered, courteous and make it more easy to understand.

00:17:12.760 --> 00:17:15.840
The person is Chiaki you are talking to, what will happen if you anger her?

00:17:15.840 --> 00:17:17.430
I see.

00:17:31.190 --> 00:17:32.190
Chiaki.

00:17:32.610 --> 00:17:35.900
I'm male.

00:17:37.410 --> 00:17:40.160
What about it, idiot.

00:17:44.620 --> 00:17:46.710
This guy... is hopeless.

00:17:47.120 --> 00:17:48.460
Minami-ke.

00:17:55.050 --> 00:17:58.010
Will the day I revert back to Makoto ever come?

00:17:58.010 --> 00:18:00.640
It will be nice if you do revert back.

00:18:02.600 --> 00:18:05.770
But today, let's transform you to Mako-chan again.

00:18:05.770 --> 00:18:07.980
I can't get my spirits up...

00:18:10.230 --> 00:18:12.070
This is my transformation set.

00:18:12.070 --> 00:18:14.070
As always, you are fully prepared.

00:18:14.070 --> 00:18:16.070
The day you revert to Makoto will never come.

00:18:16.900 --> 00:18:18.240
I'm back.

00:18:18.820 --> 00:18:20.700
Cold, cold.

00:18:21.990 --> 00:18:23.160
Welcome back.

00:18:23.160 --> 00:18:24.700
It's cold, need heater.

00:18:24.700 --> 00:18:26.040
Welcome.

00:18:26.040 --> 00:18:27.210
Sorry to intrude.

00:18:27.210 --> 00:18:29.460
Chiaki, put your coat away.

00:18:29.460 --> 00:18:32.170
Sorry about that, Haruka-neesama.

00:18:51.190 --> 00:18:54.190
Now that I think of it, there's a magic show on TV today.

00:18:54.190 --> 00:18:55.730
Oh, let's watch it.

00:18:55.730 --> 00:18:57.690
<i>Must not see, must not see.</i>

00:19:01.240 --> 00:19:03.370
<b>Magic of Miracles
The Invisible Ninomiya-kun</b>

00:19:03.370 --> 00:19:04.370
Sensei.

00:19:04.370 --> 00:19:04.790
<b>Magic of Miracles
The Invisible Ninomiya-kun</b>

00:19:04.790 --> 00:19:06.080
Ninomiya-kun.

00:19:06.080 --> 00:19:07.200
<b>Magic of Miracles
The Invisible Ninomiya-kun</b>

00:19:08.080 --> 00:19:10.080
It's the trick of piercing swords into the box.

00:19:10.080 --> 00:19:13.040
You just have to skillfully avoid the blade.

00:19:15.380 --> 00:19:16.250
Ninomiya-kun.

00:19:16.800 --> 00:19:17.670
Sensei.

00:19:18.510 --> 00:19:20.010
Ninomiya-kun.

00:19:20.010 --> 00:19:20.970
Sensei.

00:19:21.760 --> 00:19:23.430
Ninomiya-kun?

00:19:23.430 --> 00:19:24.720
Sensei...

00:19:25.390 --> 00:19:27.430
Ninomiya-kun...!

00:19:27.430 --> 00:19:28.770
Sensei...

00:19:29.940 --> 00:19:31.230
Ninomiya-kun!

00:19:32.650 --> 00:19:33.190
Sen...

00:19:33.190 --> 00:19:35.570
That is so dangerous.

00:19:35.570 --> 00:19:36.650
Suddenly...

00:19:46.160 --> 00:19:48.120
Hey, Kana.

00:19:48.120 --> 00:19:50.500
Don't hit so hard, you'll destroy the heated table.

00:19:50.500 --> 00:19:53.080
What? That wasn't me.

00:19:54.500 --> 00:19:55.840
Hey.

00:19:55.840 --> 00:19:58.510
It isn't me.

00:19:59.090 --> 00:20:03.720
<i>Kana sure is having fun, it's a matter of time before it's exposed.</i>

00:20:07.560 --> 00:20:09.850
<i>Huh? Where did Makoto go?</i>

00:20:09.850 --> 00:20:12.190
<i>This is Touma's leg...</i>

00:20:17.520 --> 00:20:19.990
<i>Seeking help from Touma, huh...</i>

00:20:19.990 --> 00:20:21.190
<i>Trying to avoid death.</i>

00:20:25.410 --> 00:20:26.660
Don't move from there.

00:20:27.120 --> 00:20:28.450
It's suffocating.

00:20:30.120 --> 00:20:32.040
<i>It's time to save him now.</i>

00:20:32.040 --> 00:20:33.080
Touma,

00:20:33.750 --> 00:20:35.670
show us your magic.

00:20:39.500 --> 00:20:42.220
Stuffing the bottom of this table with clothes and then making a beautiful girl appear.

00:20:46.720 --> 00:20:47.680
Sensei.

00:20:47.680 --> 00:20:48.680
Ninomiya-kun.

00:20:48.680 --> 00:20:51.480
What are you saying all of a sudden?

00:20:51.480 --> 00:20:54.190
You can do it, right Touma?

00:20:59.440 --> 00:21:01.490
Firstly, put the clothes under the table.

00:21:05.570 --> 00:21:06.910
Faster.

00:21:11.580 --> 00:21:12.540
Amazing...!

00:21:13.330 --> 00:21:15.000
Now for the skirt.

00:21:17.830 --> 00:21:19.420
Don't show me that.

00:21:25.180 --> 00:21:26.680
Amazing...!

00:21:28.680 --> 00:21:30.350
Well then, the final one...

00:21:32.020 --> 00:21:33.850
Ouch, ouch... it hurts...

00:21:43.610 --> 00:21:45.240
Amazing...!

00:21:45.240 --> 00:21:48.280
Were you under the table the entire time?

00:21:48.280 --> 00:21:50.080
Welcome, Mako-chan.

00:21:50.910 --> 00:21:54.620
It's really an average magic trick, to think that you can pull it off.

00:21:54.620 --> 00:21:55.710
Eh?

00:21:56.000 --> 00:21:58.080
Eh...?

00:23:31.130 --> 00:23:32.140
Next Episode

00:23:32.140 --> 00:23:33.470
I'm Minami Touma.
Next Episode

00:23:33.470 --> 00:23:33.680
Be it males, brothers or sisters, they are all troublesome.
Next Episode

00:23:33.680 --> 00:23:36.510
Be it males, brothers or sisters, they are all troublesome.

00:23:36.510 --> 00:23:38.680
Next episode, Neighbor Minami-san.

00:23:38.680 --> 00:23:39.730
This is a story of my home,

00:23:39.730 --> 00:23:40.230
Neighbor Minami-san
This is a story of my home,

00:23:40.230 --> 00:23:42.690
it's nothing interesting, so don't expect much.
Neighbor Minami-san

00:23:42.690 --> 00:23:45.650
Taking the preview all to yourself, what a show off.
Neighbor Minami-san

00:23:45.650 --> 00:23:46.150
Neighbor Minami-san
